WEBVTT

0:00:00.800 --> 0:00:02.933
The first train leaves at six.

10:00:10.940 --> 10:00:20.750
The second train leaves at seven.

0010:00:30.940 --> 0010:00:40.750
The bus waits outside the station.

010:00:40.940 --> 010:00:50.750
The ferry crosses the bay at noon.

100:00:10.750 --> 100:00:20.810
The last tram runs at midnight.

0100:00:30.750 --> 0100:00:40.810
The night bus stops at every corner.

1000:00:22.860 --> 1000:00:25.560
The station closes for the night.
